  "2026-08-17T07:44:11.138Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-08-17: searched all statuses for GH-1051, package catalog output budget, and mode-sensitive package reads. No item owns this exact failure; pm-479ggz is the closed prior diagnostic-mode analogue, pm-5t33or owns universal budget contracts, and pm-tnud owns package grammar. Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1051"
  "2026-08-17T08:19:49.098Z","harness:codex","Tracker quality: replaced the generic package-grammar relation with depends_on because mode-sensitive catalog support is constrained by the package grammar contract."
